{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_title", "source_sha256": "fae0a5b559e4b234882a4315d8c6b97dea59996889cbacfac437ce4718c85ac2", "ja": "ううん、なんでもない。", "zh": "不，什么事也没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_synopsis", "source_sha256": "74c5e3ef2807a965ee9645844dfb281641c200f6a70e70b899aa7ed33b354e58", "ja": "センターを任された桃子は自信を見せるもの\nの、プレッシャーからレッスンでミスを繰り\n返してしまう。しかし仲間やプロデューサー\nの言葉で、みんなと一緒に楽しむ事が大切と\n気づき、公演を成功させる。", "zh": "被选为Center的桃子虽然展现出自信，\n却由于压力而在练习时不断出错。\n不过，听了伙伴和制作人的话之后，\n她察觉到重要的是和大家一起享受表演，\n于是顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63e3aa064e2a9bcace1a4c655038fb5199035be28aae24fffcf8401b278b6c48", "ja": "（今日から、次の公演のレッスンが本格的に始まる。\nみんな、そろそろ揃ったかな……）", "zh": "（从今天起，要正式开始下次公演的练习了。\n大家差不多到齐了吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1de455fd680940682165b23216b1e7e46d4995bf17493eaf59df6dc575ed337d", "ja": "おはよう！\nうん、だいたい揃ってるみたいだな。", "zh": "早安！\n嗯，看来大致都到齐了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "3c59c85f8667e628ae098e0fb0c3687f4d5d3d4e29b49ce5f9e67cd27eb1e6fc", "ja": "おやぶん！　今度の公演のセンター、\nももこって本当！？　本当なら、たまきも出たいぞ～！", "zh": "老大！听说下次公演的Center是桃子，是真的吗！？\n是的话，那环也想上场～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "8d18fbf278110990153286ce8261538cd6d3c647b157d3ed787637fd4dabafe6", "ja": "今日のレッスンに呼ばれてるんだから、\n環もメンバーに決まってるでしょ。よろしくね。", "zh": "都被叫来参加今天的练习了，那环当然也是公演成员啰。\n请多指教啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "01d4bbfb1f3824bb0dcd5c3b38556b308482bec226377f838f4a500f3a30c96d", "ja": "ほんと！？　たまきも出ていいの？\nありがとう、おやぶん！", "zh": "真的！？环也可以上场吗？\n谢谢你，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "940147a8967ec682df43b7dcc71dd76b2e327edcb749c464df6d9c05821689f5", "ja": "一緒にがんばりましょうね、環ちゃん！\n{$P$}さん、レッスンはまだですか？", "zh": "一起加油吧，小环！\n{$P$}先生，还没有要开始练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f23fd0d129233366fdd352fd447dfa606eb0fc20db0971a6c2c93032d3e2f683", "ja": "そうだな。\nそれじゃあ、そろそろレッスンを始めて……。", "zh": "也是呢。\n那么，差不多可以开始练习了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "e5f48cf8a1dd252d26da805ec4768931d3a61d19c20f11c108c99a4ef7148a79", "ja": "待って、お兄ちゃん。公演のメンバーは5人だって\n聞いたんだけど。まだ、4人しか来てないよ。", "zh": "等等，大哥哥，桃子听说公演成员是五个人，\n但现在只来了四个人喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "0bef846682c215cee4e18c571a3d00a3c087a45e60b131e99361ce77ec8d93f8", "ja": "全員そろうまで、レッスンは\n始めないほうがいいんじゃない？", "zh": "等全员都到齐再开始练习比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1009_p", "source_sha256": "77e4a27e24c07f62d5955477113277a8e423c5ac28e49bac89a09ee64499f0c6", "ja": "おっと、そうだった！\nすまない、フライングするところだったな。", "zh": "哎呀，你说得对！\n抱歉，差点就要提早开练了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "0e4b2fb07a4359af33a782fdec57fb121f7f5da0d94c71cded05bdbf8b95a744", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃんがそんなことでどうするの？", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥你这个样子是该怎么办啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "68168364bfb9bfa61ac46ffdc4d35ce610e9f5e56bbe7a97d6e71cfac8fbbb0f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あとひとりって誰なの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，还有一位成员是谁啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3ea51a973e699f709d7308da1ee3bc24e2c1d89a64d8ccfed6187800704e5e9b", "ja": "ああ、もうひとりは……。", "zh": "啊，还有一位是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1013_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "6334a9774a0ae9aeb7abdd91255842e08b1fcff53469a1d85eb3583efc58e272", "ja": "おはようございまーす！\n……あれ？　わ、私、遅刻しちゃいましたか！？", "zh": "早安──！\n……咦？我、我迟到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "0289b22b887aed76535179d77366ecf25f3461d7c89f84847c2aa367e110c83a", "ja": "あっ、やよいさんだ！　おはよう！", "zh": "啊，是弥生姊姊！早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1016_p", "source_sha256": "da88eb40a5e227ec68c480582511c260708bb53d0990f7ffb2f6bfdedba40130", "ja": "おはよう、やよい！　いや、時間ピッタリだよ。\nよし、これで全員揃ったな。", "zh": "早安，弥生！不，你准时来了喔。\n好，这样就全员到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "f276d047f5d74771bf636277766f61fb783881c6a726b0089bd344633ded883f", "ja": "え……やよいさんが、5人目？\nお兄ちゃん、もしかして……。", "zh": "咦……弥生姊是第五位？\n大哥哥，难道说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1018_p", "source_sha256": "16cde6ecb633666e252f926dcccb0d3b6b397a4707ccb98cf15e418fac09ce98", "ja": "うん。今回は桃子、育、星梨花、環、やよい、\n同年代の5人でステージに立ってもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "嗯，我这次想让桃子、育、星梨花、环、弥生，\n你们五个年龄相仿的人一起站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "3066bb640c51fd7e92221d40bfdd39a0988899e90e9f8e2c5af112dbfdb4ef6d", "ja": "同年代、って……。\nちょっと、お兄ちゃん！？", "zh": "年龄相仿……\n等等，大哥哥！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1020_p", "source_sha256": "60df124a9959ef15f7915d3664b4c55c518377d549ed4c6a38dd9b39983df360", "ja": "ん？\n桃子、同年代の仲間だけじゃ不安か？", "zh": "嗯？\n桃子，只有年龄相仿的伙伴会不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "25d85f45fc4d3137063c374f47d18a1cdec12976b1d05278b25408112f4c61d1", "ja": "そ、そういうわけじゃないけど……。", "zh": "也、也不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "4eb22a55e1e725472af492c3fa5ca4683606936eb16460c2929b38b1ccce9b6c", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、桃子！　この中では私がいちばん\nお姉さんだから、ちょっとドキドキだけど……。", "zh": "没问题的，桃子！\n我在这里面是最年长的姊姊，虽然有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "fc4e6c305b123a8af0d3446fbecc6d21fa6d26d8bb87d0180cf4d4898da5d45d", "ja": "みんなで目いっぱい、楽しいライブにしようね！\nがんばりましょー！", "zh": "不过大家一起尽全力办场开心的演唱会吧！\n加油──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "4effbb09ed68087f89fd4f11f2cbb3f07628eedba39be2a9475155034099503c", "ja": "やよいさん、すっごく先輩って感じがする……！\nえへへ、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "弥生姊姊，好有前辈的感觉……！\n嘿嘿，请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "c82ec4d876c57eecd37e8e6d939e63c619b0c94bee763b7ecbf59244eeb16b65", "ja": "やよいさんと桃子ちゃんがいるんだから、\n次の公演も、ぜったい成功するよね♪", "zh": "有弥生姊姊和桃子在，\n下次公演绝对会成功的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "c044412ca4492e9905f6cb04555961c7f2c9b2763aa193987a5060da52c6fbae", "ja": "あ、当たり前でしょ？　桃子のセンター公演なんだし、\n成功するに決まってるよ！", "zh": "当、当然啦。\n这可是桃子的Center公演，一定会很成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "713de25dc080d7d8275ef6c96dcf7234be15e556f083adf19390bb6697cf8cd3", "ja": "おお……。ももこ、すっごくかっこいい！\nたまきも負けないぞ～！", "zh": "喔喔……桃子，真是太帅了！\n环也不会输的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "4b3f207d71eb8df6a52b3f7e6ee3f9fd1849b3e7304085640542c1959295e957", "ja": "私も、なんだか、うきうきしてきちゃいました！\nレッスンがんばろうね、桃子ちゃん♪", "zh": "我也有点雀跃起来了！\n一起加油练习吧，小桃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "3ec3aeb56a07b2e18ad894aef48734aa34b3961f6802ddc11010d8d9e098cc66", "ja": "うん。みんな、桃子についてくれば大丈夫だから！\n桃子にまかせて……。", "zh": "嗯，只要大家跟上桃子的脚步就没有问题了！\n包在桃子身上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a3858ebdef3e57d3b20df83aa5933474d1a59c25ab496dee4047bf467c572ff", "ja": "あ、桃子ちゃん！\nセンターって、ひとりでがんばっちゃダメなんだって。", "zh": "啊，桃子！\nCenter可不能自己一个人埋头苦干喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "25966963d712c47c659701c8fb1806006c52069b3040b7381936779ec73e7a10", "ja": "え？　……どうして？", "zh": "咦？……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "223c83d98ebbfb6dab580ca7599f00bfaece04c4353dde60eb27cab5d799c97f", "ja": "わたし、センターになったとき、全部\nひとりでやらなくちゃって思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "我担任Center的时候，\n以为所有事都得自己一个人做才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "141c7d85031f04c5a99909febc68eb2788fbf1db7271c2c2574c9cc018c8a98a", "ja": "でも、ちがったの。大人って、仲間といっしょに\n助け合いながら、がんばれる人のことなんだって！", "zh": "但那样是不对的，能够和伙伴互相帮助一起努力的人，\n才称得上是大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1034_p", "source_sha256": "53dd0e5025422251a32084e6f452d5e17258da659c9f1fe401c1b85f5f4fba57", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n育、ちゃんと覚えてたんだな。えらいぞ。", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n育有好好记住了呢，真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb1b4d76b1ead3fc7b5969e16b303cb9cec651ea70be192a48dd5f093da869e0", "ja": "でも、桃子ちゃんなら大丈夫だよね。\nみんなで、すごいステージが作れると思う！", "zh": "不过，桃子的话没问题吧。\n我觉得大家一定可以一起做出很棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb499154876ebf130bdc1c43b2f38d21cdd7304ddffd613b0fcce2298830eb6b", "ja": "と、当然だよ。桃子はみんなの意見だって聞くし。\nプロとして……ちゃんと、いい公演にするんだから。", "zh": "当、当然啰，桃子也会听取大家的意见。\n身为专业人士……会好好做出一场很棒的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "cc77ee7ba407893707eea34afe95631176be32d58a68e2233be300c0fd8fbb22", "ja": "みんな、そろそろお話はストップ！\nレッスンの準備をして、10分後に集合だよ！", "zh": "大家，差不多该停止闲聊了！\n做好练习的准备，10分钟后集合喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1040_040tam", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1044_005yay", "source_sha256": "634af4d18b44f1bbc5ee071fd94aca30336d07238a77749d48b5ac055cdc1b1e", "ja": "桃子……？", "zh": "桃子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1045_p", "source_sha256": "8a5deec494f9d9e10d06bc3ebb202d9d73f6c493be657757d0d20be2019892c0", "ja": "（桃子、まだ少し不安なのかもしれないな……。\nでも、やよいも何か気づいたみたいだ。少し見守るか）", "zh": "（桃子，可能还是有点不安吧……\n但是弥生好像也注意到什么了，稍微观望一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1046_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "4bc9992121b6db4292a92f52d7faea37746bcacf966d8e89bbc72829e7111e47", "ja": "……ふぅ。", "zh": "……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1048_005yay", "source_sha256": "db69efd3466e9f33b17c7a9498eff3004a49e4f3a72e7ab2623194b92852cf27", "ja": "桃子、ちょっといい？", "zh": "桃子，有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "f595ad2596f650c51b19f88075725301b4b3a70e25d548b7a590aee0efed7bd3", "ja": "きゃっ！\n……や、やよいさん？　なに？", "zh": "呀！\n……弥、弥生姊？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1050_005yay", "source_sha256": "432fb584c8edd7c2b2f56154b85b8b03e463b064f8d4f1e1c0555ee4ee03d911", "ja": "えっとね。うちの妹とか弟達も、私や両親が忙しいと、\n急にしゃべらなくなっちゃうんだよね。", "zh": "那个啊，有时我和父母忙碌起来，我的弟妹们\n也会突然变得很安静呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1051_049mom", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1052_005yay", "source_sha256": "810b7da3b0eb45743fefb55e5ad06d16705a32a5f86090821013e5249d4330b1", "ja": "話したいこととか、話さなきゃいけないこととかも、\nエンリョして話してくれなくなっちゃうみたい。", "zh": "即使有想说的，或是应该说出口的事，\n也会因为有所顾虑而不愿开口的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1053_049mom", "source_sha256": "53b71943233ab129b51c46f31eef0c8e256f315c861833e8f2a8002199be0d91", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ。\nふーん……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1054_005yay", "source_sha256": "619250dcff29216549585c15d7231c1980022e60d281e1a712745bd5e452d41f", "ja": "不思議だよね！　それで、もっと不思議なのは、\n言いたいことが言えないと元気がなくなってくるんだ。", "zh": "很不可思议对吧！而且，更不可思议的是，\n有话想说却说不出口的时候，就会变得无精打采喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1055_049mom", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1056_005yay", "source_sha256": "e2d8f5e3df1bba57e75104a27a2d7668021ebf5fa30b7cc580209c3a20ebc59c", "ja": "桃子、なんだか元気がないみたいだから。\n言いたいこと、ちゃんと言えてないのかなー？って。", "zh": "因为桃子看起来好像没什么精神，\n所以我猜是不是有话想说，却没有好好说出口呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1057_005yay", "source_sha256": "1b2831e05213aa25fcb0f46b390123ef9283e2185c041d057b3e933925136a29", "ja": "心配なこととか不安なことは、エンリョしないで\n言っていいんだよ！　みんな、仲間なんだから。", "zh": "如果感到担心或不安，不用顾虑，\n可以说出来喔！毕竟大家都是伙伴嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "759e4b87743f4ef4832564ce118356f992078b084067f7e27da92154c364bd6d", "ja": "遠慮とか、してないけど……。も、もし桃子に\nそういうことがあったら……ちゃんと言うから。", "zh": "桃子没有特别顾虑啦……\n如、如果桃子有那样的烦恼……会好好说出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1059_005yay", "source_sha256": "3304d8d5e435ff7fbfed95fb2d2ab99cf41f6be5b7f794ea33edced32c7a08bc", "ja": "うん、約束っ！\nそれじゃ、レッスンがんばろー！　おー！", "zh": "嗯，说好啰！\n那就一起努力练习吧！喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1060_049mom", "source_sha256": "e83e5fb7b242c87894962da29d05aecc857c615e5bcf81963f70ca209c0e9a3d", "ja": "お、おー……。", "zh": "喔、喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1061_p", "source_sha256": "5394cf7440bbc586d02fb2fb416ab760867ce543f1f6a3d40ca9a982a5fb9233", "ja": "（やよいが、上手く桃子にアドバイスをしてくれた。\n劇場のみんな同様、やよいも成長している……）", "zh": "（弥生很巧妙地给了桃子建议。\n就跟剧场的大家一样，弥生也在成长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1062_p", "source_sha256": "cc67948f9ab74a7f151d52f46fe79b866f20bfa170f023c3822b1cbec4a4bafa", "ja": "（後は桃子自身の問題だけど、はたして……）", "zh": "（再来就是桃子自己的问题了，究竟……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1063_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1064_049mom", "source_sha256": "a901b5bfb85ecb7bcf8a610f4e70b033da9d4eda1b2ea5751ba9543e51912f38", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。", "zh": "呼、呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1065_022ser", "source_sha256": "d04c4db21e6b6d276a6925520a5419fe91dbe7d2b3de4b6aa6ddcff1d3deb346", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、大丈夫？", "zh": "小桃，你还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1066_049mom", "source_sha256": "46b7e22c95a2a7c240438213c44f9b9dd8799d295dd6c0051d2321bb37c6e33c", "ja": "う、うん。\n大丈夫……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1067_p", "source_sha256": "15942e84b17dac2186ac312fbcbda9c54b0290282c57c410382752e5e870c2b0", "ja": "（桃子……普段より少し、ミスが目立つな。\n集中できてないのか……）", "zh": "（桃子……出错的情形比平常要明显一些呢。\n是不是没办法集中精神呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1068_p", "source_sha256": "c199baf9169803872ea6c830a29fb8e0f1e2035f920eb3b5000b1e8f320a86c7", "ja": "いったん休憩しようか。\n15分後にレッスン再開だ。", "zh": "先休息一下吧，\n15分钟后再继续练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1069_049mom", "source_sha256": "944a62f0d92a06982a2773dec5f9da75c187edb5938e0b1c70ca85024d070e9e", "ja": "桃子、飲み物買ってくる……。", "zh": "桃子，去买饮料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1070_022ser", "source_sha256": "1bdb5fe116476208613ad3d6d58e0469a8436068b76d598013cfb4fdfda09aca", "ja": "あっ……桃子ちゃん！", "zh": "啊……小桃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1071_p", "source_sha256": "b5e45f3d9fa2c0ec93fe41431878b6b13d05323e46247137033df14bf9240e76", "ja": "みんなは、ここで休憩していてくれ。\nやよい、みんなのこと頼むな。", "zh": "大家留在这边休息。\n弥生，麻烦你照顾一下大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1072_005yay", "source_sha256": "f2a3defc07941c2f98123fc3c6764b02407f4965c10c2f88d28ec04eabefa1c6", "ja": "はい！\n{$P$}、いってらっしゃい！", "zh": "好的！\n{$P$}，请慢走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1073_049mom", "source_sha256": "70e8f765d99ff79cbf8f6a5f2e07d553dbf5ed4d196eea12f6f7754b9cd37dfe", "ja": "桃子はセンターだから、\nしっかりしなきゃいけないのに……。", "zh": "桃子可是Center，\n明明要好好振作才行的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1074_p", "source_sha256": "e12d47db37a5315f76e789d3bf579f0f8dca2159d07dd7648101116fac8742ef", "ja": "桃子、お疲れさま。\n飲み物は買えたか？", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了。\n买到饮料了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1075_049mom", "source_sha256": "90e8f9b4b43406e6c926778e4f9f45205f2c5c3741e4835658ab204ce5e47c84", "ja": "お、お兄ちゃん！？\nどうしてここに……。", "zh": "大、大哥哥！？\n你怎么在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1076_p", "source_sha256": "3023cf9323a42ceea666e9baa8f9e2c65cfee4634ccaf2b1760cc4f8e582a9b3", "ja": "うん、桃子と少し話そうと思って。\n今日はあんまり、調子良くなさそうだな。", "zh": "嗯，因为我想和桃子稍微聊聊。\n感觉你今天好像状况不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1077_049mom", "source_sha256": "9ae71b472c516373f4b2350cb49c33c72e7bb3ae4b7095f48f6742e601efe4fd", "ja": "べ、別に、そんなことないけど……。\n初日だから、調子が出ないだけだよ。", "zh": "没、没有啊，没有那种事……\n只是因为第一天练习，还没进入状况而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1078_049mom", "source_sha256": "7f4dcc1acd957aaa6e6af3406a4e1fb1b9624bfc5a4fbcd2efb05e3127859d0a", "ja": "もう、わざわざそんなこと聞きにきたの？\nそんなヒマがあったら、レッスンを……。", "zh": "真是的，你是特地来问这种事的吗？\n如果这么闲，就把练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1079_p", "source_sha256": "e5b0db967e0b5689f424c0dff99f70bb5f666cf4a56937bd48f1325008df4800", "ja": "桃子。今、楽しいか？", "zh": "桃子，你现在开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1080_049mom", "source_sha256": "f9dbac4e2f3957a2fe9f2f69dd36bebccc52b29ce872f2b1a68a020b3eb32b2e", "ja": "え？　急に、なに……。", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这么问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1081_p", "source_sha256": "20cc89210a8ce17ab44e96f8c6c61abeb914f739b756b74866a1763c5b9b119a", "ja": "桃子は、自分はプロだって言ってたけど。俺は、\n見に来てくれるファンのみんなも、プロだと思う。", "zh": "虽然桃子总说自己是专业人士，\n不过我觉得，来看公演的粉丝们也都是专业人士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1082_049mom", "source_sha256": "9e583d30dd37ca6e7b7b64ed2e733762a0b0dba1c85f316b1b5a35c7a38621d2", "ja": "ファンのみんなが、プロ……？", "zh": "粉丝们是，专业人士……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1083_p", "source_sha256": "3564f0b179bfbc6637b6df418b3b98cbf5fa72aa2d8e555ba27ed0015bd55e0f", "ja": "そうだよ。\nアイドルの『周防桃子』を、たくさん知ってる人達だ。", "zh": "没错。\n他们是对偶像『周防桃子』了若指掌的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1084_p", "source_sha256": "6bcd6864d992a4b617fd79ed00a0cc0b6ecf3770e235dbc07164a874cb25a447", "ja": "そんな人達が見るステージで、桃子が嘘を吐いても、\n全部、わかっちゃうんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想，即使桃子在舞台上撒了谎，\n来看演出的这些人，也想必一眼就能全部识破吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1085_049mom", "source_sha256": "95324987e950c183281efbe27cd30f6f63286f7e66d18fe8d49b5fc0d6f7fdfa", "ja": "ウソって、どういう意味？\n桃子、別にウソなんか何も……。", "zh": "撒谎？什么意思？\n桃子才没有撒什么谎……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1086_p", "source_sha256": "821ac47cd68b16f32888756fab38a7bfe1aa3ecf31b9ce8953148d343c410c10", "ja": "うん。嘘というよりは、隠し事かな。\nさっき、やよいに言われた事は覚えてるだろ？", "zh": "嗯，与其说是撒谎，该说是有事隐瞒吧。\n刚刚弥生跟你说的话，你还记得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1088_040tam", "source_sha256": "b76f950ebf52f002151dc4c42c865c4c7cfd14eb29e14f6ba1e85c9c7301e00f", "ja": "わああ～っ！", "zh": "哇啊啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1089_030iku", "source_sha256": "40bca997c7917c13c1f19112f6d29428c50f902e7ceeb015ab1ffd40503ece1f", "ja": "きゃああっ！", "zh": "呀啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1090_022ser", "source_sha256": "40bca997c7917c13c1f19112f6d29428c50f902e7ceeb015ab1ffd40503ece1f", "ja": "きゃああっ！", "zh": "呀啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1091_se", "source_sha256": "ab7915d1419e44dd75b84630f5add56acfad0ce68c6a0e0ecdfdef4818f7dcba", "ja": "ドッシーン！！", "zh": "咚！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1092_p", "source_sha256": "663d30131fa05dd05545e06ba0247a67eb58fa9fd0ac1735a0c276d19f841845", "ja": "な、なんだ！？", "zh": "怎、怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1093_049mom", "source_sha256": "de6616e3388044dcbb36cb523c6da447647347ade0c961fe08d96299e361df2d", "ja": "えっ……みんな！？", "zh": "咦……大家！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1094_049mom", "source_sha256": "9a8f6ac4db25130b7528521de0e0d1bf5583c14a3f56bece122e6b6ac8b0be25", "ja": "もう、いつからのぞいてたの！？", "zh": "真是的，从什么时候开始偷看的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1095_040tam", "source_sha256": "bc29146e53bc68da02a8578bb3d3ecd0472aa6ca632b99ece0a50bb2184cde71", "ja": "ち、ちがうぞ、ももこ！\nふたりが帰ってくるのが遅いから……！", "zh": "没、没有啦，桃子！\n因为你们两个过了很久都还没回来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1096_022ser", "source_sha256": "7741b0eb01e23062a29664303c256ab6a79668872eef23ce3300154d457907fe", "ja": "わたしたち、桃子ちゃんが心配だったんです！\nだから、気になっちゃって……。", "zh": "因为我们很担心小桃！\n所以很在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1097_030iku", "source_sha256": "0eaa3133e90063b1c7fece2aa76e2bb555e69d8008f58bbb25e173c7943c4eff", "ja": "桃子ちゃん！\nあのね、何か心配なことがあるなら言ってほしい！", "zh": "桃子！\n如果有什么担心事，我希望你可以说出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1098_030iku", "source_sha256": "664bf35ee3ffaa88a92124d021abc6b3a099561028ff6f74344bce568248a194", "ja": "桃子ちゃんみたいに、なんでもできないけど……\nわたしたち、いっしょうけんめいがんばるから！", "zh": "虽然不像桃子一样，什么事都办得到……\n但是，我们会拚命努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1099_049mom", "source_sha256": "ae7804e14b5046f12144ec03b0e0f09d5fd11da4b4a481c5c18e1402cee5e2e9", "ja": "みんな……。", "zh": "大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1100_005yay", "source_sha256": "2d8b80baf05f3d3cbaf31b0bb1b82a8eae36cfa72c6cd20ee552cd525d69cde7", "ja": "桃子。\nみんな、桃子のこと心配してるよ。", "zh": "桃子，\n大家都很担心你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1101_049mom", "source_sha256": "27cf2bc9df906f96e7a535f0498e39a9c038b368245cfebee99453e8a92487fc", "ja": "あの……桃子ね。本当は、少しだけ……\nセンターをやるの、緊張してて……。", "zh": "那个……桃子啊，\n其实，对于担任Center这件事……有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1102_049mom", "source_sha256": "dfc06a3378557d93d32a85cfd1978377af7c64dbdb66fd547523cf12febea9ba", "ja": "でも桃子、やるからには最高の公演にしたい。\nだからお願い！　みんなの力を貸して……！", "zh": "但是桃子既然要做，就想做出最棒的公演。\n所以拜托了！请大家借给桃子力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1103_030iku", "source_sha256": "e4b9a8dd47bc93b95218ef1212d9d44b2749d661997c384cdbab2643798ddf3f", "ja": "うん、まかせて！\nいっしょに、楽しいステージにしようね！", "zh": "嗯，交给我！\n一起做出一场开心的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1104_022ser", "source_sha256": "e9899a0369937ac2c74a6c89ca31c2ba85ea36a209cec25fa2ecbf98c58b49b4", "ja": "わたしも、桃子ちゃんがいつもどおり\n思いっきり歌えるように、がんばります！", "zh": "我也是。\n为了让小桃能够像平常一样尽情歌唱，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1105_040tam", "source_sha256": "067e413d33cfa0e5f7ebe9c0b8895317627adad19a535779462838f1a6498d55", "ja": "たまきも、いっぱい手伝う！　くふふ、\nたまきも、ももこと一緒にできるの楽しみだぞ！", "zh": "环也会全力帮忙的！\n呵呵，环也很期待可以和桃子一起表演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1106_005yay", "source_sha256": "20128c90f8e4e92a688346d29894a244fb7122f0368dbd9a06c14e16f43adc2d", "ja": "ね？　不安なことでも、\nみんな、ちゃんと受け取ってくれたでしょ？", "zh": "看吧？就算感到不安，\n大家也都会理解你的，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1107_049mom", "source_sha256": "742b083897d9cea9ad35e38646ad2b0e42526666cac742b06637178e6c6b86fd", "ja": "うん。\nやよいさん、ありがとう……。", "zh": "嗯。\n弥生姊，谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1108_p", "source_sha256": "0a1f77b40ddb76177569ccaae1c16277ab6b6631878edef2f8777a7ff5217d90", "ja": "（桃子のプロ意識の高さは、\nアイドルとしてかけがえのないものだ）", "zh": "（桃子极其敬业的态度，\n是身为一名偶像无可取代的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1109_p", "source_sha256": "726331ba66e3487a0ebacd00ec416a1333a58dc65cc94f34eaea895b178167c8", "ja": "（けどそれ以外の大事な事も、\n劇場で、みんなから学び始めている）", "zh": "（不过除此之外，她也开始在剧场\n向大家学习其他必须重视的事了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1110_049mom", "source_sha256": "d9bfdc5ec08ec2ef82a37374ba31a96ddb98d5e6f3be7b417d57a32210f36700", "ja": "えっと……お、お兄ちゃん。\nその……。", "zh": "呃……大、大哥哥，\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1111_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1112_049mom", "source_sha256": "7bf040b8c171d831f5e81afdb49b7bcd9394df17af73914e09403dd7a13ba33f", "ja": "や、やっぱり、なんでもないっ。\n……いーっだ！", "zh": "算、算了，什么事也没有。\n……讨厌鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_032_1113_p", "source_sha256": "297f238b38e9b2e622ecda89bff3fa50b824ffff44bc37cc103f0396450fa0a4", "ja": "（こ、こういうところは相変わらずだけど……\nこれも桃子の、大事な個性だな！）", "zh": "（这、这点倒是没有变……\n但这也是桃子难能可贵的个性！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
